        "original_id": "19e6de83-66be-5067-9f64-459f553753aa",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: The System, The Girl-Getters\n- People: Michael Winner, Oliver Reed, Jane Merrow, Barbara Ferris\n- Topics: British drama films, English actors\n\nFacts:\n- The System, released in 1964, is a British drama film.\n- The System was released in the United States under the title The Girl-Getters.\n- Michael Winner directed The System.\n- Oliver Reed, Jane Merrow, and Barbara Ferris starred in The System.\n- Robert Oliver Reed was born on 13 February 1938 and died on 2 May 1999.\n- Oliver Reed was an English actor.\n- Oliver Reed was known for an upper-middle-class, macho image, a hellraiser lifestyle, and tough-guy roles.",
